Foil CSS (simeydotme)
---------------------

Portions of the Pokémon foil CSS recipes are adapted from:

  pokemon-cards-css (poke-holo) and pokemon-cards-151
  Copyright (C) 2022 Simon Goellner (@simeydotme)
  <https://github.com/simeydotme/pokemon-cards-css>
  <https://github.com/simeydotme/pokemon-cards-151>
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0

Vendored reference trees (CSS only, no upstream foil PNGs) live under
volatile staging (re-sync with `pnpm foil:pokemon:simey`):

  data/pokemon/staging/simey/poke-holo/   → public/css/cards/
  data/pokemon/staging/simey/poke-151/    → public/css/cards/
  (see each tree’s UPSTREAM_COMMIT for the pinned revision)

Adapted into Placarr as `HoloShader` recipes (e.g. radiantHolo, regularHolo,
reverseHolo). See docs/foil_css_sources.md.

